 "description": "Gardner1998 - Cell Cycle Goldbeter\nBioModels BIOMD0000000008 (curated). SBML file: BIOMD0000000008_url.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 300 time units (SED-ML: BIOMD0000000008_url.sedml (auto-generated placeholder); duration chosen from the dynamics: oscillating), sampling 0.3.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 1.25e-06 of species peak (worst: Y)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] reaction2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] reaction4 term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] reaction5: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] reaction6 term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] reaction7: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): M1 = M",
